 and represents an important step toward a standardized color description.
 Colorimeters have also been used to characterize potato color traits 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{thornton2013influence}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 Recently,
 the use of photographs combined with computer vision techniques has emerged as a more precise and scalable approach 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{miller2023tubar,yusuf2024genomic,azizi2016identifying,ropelewska2021effect,feldman2024}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 Nevertheless,
