\begin_layout Standard
This study leverages historical color trait data to dissect the genetic basis of pigmentation across multiple organs of potato plants in landraces from the underexplored 
\shape italic
Andigenum
\shape default
 group,
 which is recognized for its wide color variability.
 The CCC,
 composed primarily of tetraploid 
\shape italic
Andigenum
\shape default
 landraces,
