\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A total of 599 tetraploid accessions from the CCC,
 belonging to the 
\shape italic
S.
 tuberosum Andigenum
\shape default
 group,
 were genotyped 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{Berdugo2017}
\end_layout

\end_inset

 using the Potato Illumina Infinium SolCAP SNP array version I,
 which includes 8,303 SNPs.
 Genotyping was performed using an Illumina HiScan SQ system (Illumina,
 San Diego,
 CA,
 USA) at the AGROSAVIA.
 Dosage genotype calls were obtained with the ClusterCall R package 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{Schmitz2017}
\end_layout

\end_inset

,
 which uses polar coordinates 
\begin_inset Formula $(r,\theta)$
\end_inset

 from GenomeStudio,
 applying default parameters and calibration with F1 populations.
 This process generated a genotype call matrix (0,
 AAAA;
 1,
 AAAB;
 2,
 AABB;
 3,
 ABBB;
 and 4,
 BBBB) for each SNP in all accessions.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Standard quality control filters were applied to ensure the reliability of the GWAS dataset.
 SNPs with a minor allele frequency (MAF) 
\begin_inset Formula $<1\%$
\end_inset

 were removed to eliminate rare variants with limited statistical power 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{Anderson2010}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 Individuals with more than 10% missing genotype calls (MIND 
\begin_inset Formula $>$
\end_inset

0.1) were excluded to reduce bias from low-quality samples.
 SNPs with 
\begin_inset Formula $\geq$
\end_inset

10% missing data (GENO 
\begin_inset Formula $\geq$
\end_inset

 0.1) were also filtered to preserve marker integrity and minimize imputation noise.
 In addition,
 SNPs with Hardy–Weinberg equilibrium (HWE) p-values 
\begin_inset Formula $<$
\end_inset

1e-10 were excluded,
 as extreme deviations may reflect genotyping errors,
 population structure,
 or selection 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{Wigginton2005}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 These thresholds are widely used in polyploid GWAS and are aligned with established quality-control practices 
\begin_inset ERT
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout


\backslash
citep{Lu2013,
 Pavan2020}
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
 After filtering,
 4,641 SNPs were retained for downstream genomic analyses (Figure S1 shows the SNP density across chromosomes).
\end_layout

